{"cut_proposal":{"candidate_errors":[],"prefix":"To solve for \\(c\\) in the given polynomial equation \\(x^3 - 10x^2 + 55x - c = 0\\) given that two of the roots have a product of 30, we can use Vieta's formulas and properties of polynomial roots. Let's denote the roots of the polynomial by \\(a\\), \\(b\\), and \\(c\\).\n\nFrom Vieta's formulas, we know the following relationships for the roots of the polynomial \\(x^3 - 10x^2 + 55x - c = 0\\):\n1. The sum of the roots \\(a + b + c = 10\\).\n2. The sum of the product of the roots taken two at a time \\(ab + bc + ca = 55\\).\n3. The product of the roots \\(abc = c\\).\n\nWe are given that the product of two of the roots is 30. Without loss of generality, let's assume \\(ab = 30\\). We need to find the value of \\(c\\).\n\nFrom the product of the roots, we have:\n\\[abc = c.\\]\nSince \\(ab = 30\\), we can substitute to get:\n\\[30c = c.\\]\nThis simplifies to:\n\\[30c - c = 0 \\implies 29c = 0 \\implies c = 0.\\]\n\n","prefix_end":885,"status":"review_required"},"eligible":true,"generation":{"generation":{"max_new_tokens":2048,"temperature":0.7,"top_k":0,"top_p":1.0},"ids":[1249,11625,369,17767,66,57758,304,279,2661,47311,23606,17767,87,61,18,481,220,16,15,87,61,17,488,220,20,20,87,481,272,284,220,15,57758,2661,429,1378,315,279,19703,614,264,1985,315,220,18,15,11,582,646,990,11401,1915,594,54079,323,5888,315,47311,19703,13,6771,594,78064,279,19703,315,279,47311,553,17767,64,59,701,17767,65,59,701,323,17767,66,59,3593,3830,11401,1915,594,54079,11,582,1414,279,2701,11871,369,279,19703,315,279,47311,17767,87,61,18,481,220,16,15,87,61,17,488,220,20,20,87,481,272,284,220,15,59,982,16,13,576,2629,315,279,19703,17767,64,488,293,488,272,284,220,16,15,59,4292,17,13,576,2629,315,279,1985,315,279,19703,4429,1378,518,264,882,17767,370,488,17916,488,2162,284,220,20,20,59,4292,18,13,576,1985,315,279,19703,17767,13683,284,272,59,3593,1654,525,2661,429,279,1985,315,1378,315,279,19703,374,220,18,15,13,17147,4709,315,1766,2719,11,10